- # Changes in 0.65.0
+ # Cambios en 0.65.0

- This file is read by an LLM agent to upgrade code that consumes Soundness libraries from
- 0.64.0 to 0.65.0. Each entry states precisely what changed; see `AGENTS.md` for the format.
- Entries are grouped by module, most-recently-added last within a module.
+ Este fichero lo lee un agente LLM para actualizar el código que consume las bibliotecas de
+ Soundness de 0.64.0 a 0.65.0. Cada entrada indica con precisión qué cambió; véase `AGENTS.md`
+ para el formato. Las entradas se agrupan por módulo, con las añadidas más recientemente al final
+ dentro de cada módulo.

- ## ambience
+ ## ambience

- - `ambience.systems.javaSystem` renamed to `javaBaseSystem`. (#1939)
- - `ambience.environments.javaEnvironment` renamed to `javaBaseEnvironment`. (#1939)
- - `ambience.workingDirectories.javaWorkingDirectory` renamed to `javaBaseWorkingDirectory`. (#1939)
- - `ambience.workingDirectories.defaultWorkingDirectory` removed; use `javaBaseWorkingDirectory`,
-   which reads the `user.dir` property (the removed given read `java.nio.file.Paths.get("")`,
-   which resolves to the same directory). (#1939)
- - `ambience.temporaryDirectories.javaTemporaryDirectory` renamed to `javaBaseTemporaryDirectory`. (#1939)
+ - `ambience.systems.javaSystem` se renombra a `javaBaseSystem`. (#1939)
+ - `ambience.environments.javaEnvironment` se renombra a `javaBaseEnvironment`. (#1939)
+ - `ambience.workingDirectories.javaWorkingDirectory` se renombra a `javaBaseWorkingDirectory`. (#1939)
+ - Se elimina `ambience.workingDirectories.defaultWorkingDirectory`; úsese `javaBaseWorkingDirectory`,
+   que lee la propiedad `user.dir` (el given eliminado leía `java.nio.file.Paths.get("")`, que se
+   resuelve al mismo directorio). (#1939)
+ - `ambience.temporaryDirectories.javaTemporaryDirectory` se renombra a `javaBaseTemporaryDirectory`. (#1939)

